		Paragraph: This certificate states that Marta Vidal Soler completed the course on accessible document design, with a total of forty hours of classes and practical work, between March and June 2026.
		Paragraph: Its authenticity can be checked by reading the code with a phone or by entering the number 2026-0147 on the verification page. The code leads to a page that shows the same data as this document.
		Paragraph: Below the code the paragraphs take the full width of the page again.
